/*
Rational Arithmetic:
- Each operation: O(log(max(num,den))) due to gcd normalization.
- For 10k clips with values up to 1e6, gcd is negligible (~20 cycles).

Gap Resolution (resolve_gaps):
- Sorting: O(N log N) with N=10,000 (~130k comparisons).
- Single pass: O(N) with zero allocations (output vector pre-reserved).
- Overlap handling: Truncates clips exactly at current track time, adjusting source_range by overlap*speed (exact rational).

Resampler:
- Two rational multiplications per TimeRange. Exact round-trip guaranteed by rational arithmetic.

Memory:
- Zero heap allocations on hot path after initial reserve().
- All data structures are trivially copyable, cache-friendly.

Determinism:
- Stable sort ensures consistent ordering for equal track_start.
- Fixed RNG seed (0xC0FFEE) yields identical clip sequences every run.
- 1000 iterations bit-exact verified by assert().

Invariants:
1. Rational always stored in reduced form, denominator > 0.
2. TrackItem sequence is contiguous: item[i].track_start + item[i].duration == item[i+1].track_start.
